                <p>December 28, 29, and 31. See <ref target="#d128">Document 128</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d120-f3" n="3" xml:id="d120-f3-content">
                <p>Not further identified.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d120-f4" n="4" xml:id="d120-f4-content">
                <p>Attached but not printed. In the left margin, Carter wrote: “Examined &amp; returned.”</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d120-f5" n="5" xml:id="d120-f5-content">
                <p>Carter underlined the word “students” and,
                    at the top of the first page of the memorandum, wrote: “Zbig—Please do not call
                    them students—otherwise ok. J.”</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d120-f6" n="6" xml:id="d120-f6-content">
                <p>See the attachment to <ref target="#d110">Document 110</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d120-f7" n="7" xml:id="d120-f7-content">
                <p>Monday, December 31.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
